https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Swirling_Icy_Shield\" title=\"Swirling Icy Shield\">Swirling Icy Shield</a></b><br /><b>Charges: </b>1 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 1 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)\n<ul><li><p style=\"font-size: 10px; line-height: 2px; margin: 0px;\">Dispelled if item is unequipped.<span class=\"citation\"><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php?p=6131687#post6131687\">DDO Forums</a></span>&#160;<sup id=\"old&#95;forums&#95;link&#95;1\" style=\"background-color: #FFAAAA;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/save/https%3A%2F%2Fforums-old.ddo.com%2Fforums%2Fshowthread.php%3Fp%3D6131687%23post6131687\"><abbr title=\"The old forums this link points to were shut down on August 31st, 2025. If this is important, please consider revising the template call as described at &#91;&#91;Template:Forums&#93;&#93;.\" style=\"display: initial;\">ARCHIVE ME!</abbr></a></sup></span></p></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Echo_of_Wave.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Echo_of_Wave.png/420px-Legendary_Echo_of_Wave.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"806\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Echo_of_Wave.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Schism_Shard_Crafting\" title=\"Schism Shard Crafting\">Schism Shard Crafting</a> to \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Item:Reflection_of_Wave\" title=\"Item:Reflection of Wave\">Reflection of Wave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Sphere_of_Waves\" title=\"Item:Sphere of Waves\">Sphere of Waves</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The crash of the waves echoes in your ears. Seize the moment, and swim for the surface.<br /><br />There is something missing from this legendary weapon... something that makes it feel... incomplete.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>This weapon can be upgraded to a legendary version with 5 Schism Shards found in <a href=\"/page/Killing_Time\" title=\"Killing Time\">Killing Time</a>.\nThere are two upgrade options: <a href=\"/page/Item:Reflection_of_Wave\" title=\"Item:Reflection of Wave\">Reflection of Wave</a> (a Quarterstaff), and <a href=\"/page/Item:Sphere_of_Waves\" title=\"Item:Sphere of Waves\">Sphere of Waves</a> (a Orb).\nThe Schism shard collector, <a href=\"/page/Varron_Tertius\" title=\"Varron Tertius\">Varron Tertius</a> can be found in <a href=\"/page/The_Gatekeepers%27_Grove\" title=\"The Gatekeepers&#39; Grove\">The Gatekeepers' Grove</a>.\n</p><p><b>WARNING:</b> Any Mythic or Reaper bonuses will be lost on upgrade, and it cannot be upgraded if a sentient gem is slotted into it.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817214457\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.129 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.171 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54105/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18965/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 8/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  140.662      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  140.662      1 -total\n 98.93%  139.157     80 Template:IO\n 97.02%  136.464      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 32.60%   45.858      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 31.85%   44.805      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 30.51%   42.920      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 29.78%   41.883      2 Template:InCategory\n 20.95%   29.464     14 Template:Popup\n 11.77%   16.556      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:70802-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817214457 and revision id 654940. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
